  sit("A hospitalized 5-year-old believes she is getting an injection because she was bad. This reflects ____.", "The preschooler's belief that pain is punishment for bad behavior", ["The adolescent's perception of pain at physical and emotional levels", "The school-age recognition that death exists", "The toddler's guarding of the painful area only"], "Preschooler: may believe pain is punishment for bad behavior.");


